  "body": "A substantial family home with the size, flexibility and layout to accommodate every stage of family life.\r\n\r\nSpanning two well designed levels, this home offers five bedrooms, four bathrooms and three separate living areas, making it an exceptional option for large families or those seeking genuine multi generational living. The entertainer's kitchen anchors a generous open plan living and dining area, complete with a built in coffee station, gas cooktop, walk in pantry and oversized joinery that fills the space with natural light. Sliding doors open onto an elevated deck where a covered pergola, pull down blinds and wide views create an inviting setting. A separate media room adds another living zone, while extensive storage, a guest powder room and oversized parking make everyday living easy.\r\n\r\nA master suite on the ground floor provides an excellent solution for extended family, guests or independent teenagers, complete with its own ensuite, walk in wardrobe and outdoor access. Upstairs, a second living area and dedicated office landing are accompanied by four generously sized bedrooms. The primary suite offers a walk in wardrobe, ensuite and bath, while a second bedroom also enjoys its own ensuite. The remaining two bedrooms are well proportioned and are serviced by the family bathroom, creating a practical layout that's perfect for older children, extended family or long term guests.\r\n\r\n* Ideal layout for large or multi generational families\r\n* Open plan living with in ceiling speakers and oversized joinery\r\n* Entertainer's kitchen with gas cooktop and walk in pantry\r\n* Separate living and media room plus additional upstairs living\r\n* Downstairs master suite with walk-in-robe, ensuite and outdoor access\r\n* Upstairs primary suite with walk-in-robe, ensuite and bath\r\n* Additional bedroom with ensuite and walk through wardrobe\r\n* Elevated deck with pergola, pull down blinds and expansive views\r\n* Double internal access garage plus extensive off street parking for cars, boats and campers\r\n\r\nSituated in the heart of Millwater, you'll enjoy easy access to local schools, parks, cafes, Silverdale Shopping Centre, motorway connections and the beaches of the Hibiscus Coast. The owners are motivated and ready for their next move, creating an outstanding opportunity to secure a home that offers space, flexibility and long term practicality.\r\n\r\nFor more information, please download the files within the link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/SEG4",
